,"infoEat":"金징어 된 오징어, 자원회복방안 마련한다\n- 해수부, 살오징어?주꾸미도 회복대상종으로 추가 -","display":"Y","graphComment":"","fishNameEn":"Japanese flying squid, Common squid"},"periodList":[{"month":"3","colorLevel":"1"},{"month":"4","colorLevel":"2"},{"month":"5","colorLevel":"2"},{"month":"6","colorLevel":"1"}],"imgList":[{"fileName":"fish_1575875139974_157674022055003.jpg","displayOrder":"1"},{"fileName":"fish_1575875139974_157674527840103.jpg","displayOrder":"3"}]}
